  <data name="location_override_cleanup_required" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>URnetwork haikuweza kuondoa faili ya mahali ya mfumo, hivyo mashine hii inaweza bado kuripoti mahali pa mtoa huduma. Anzisha huduma ya mfumo ya URnetwork kisha uzime chaguo hili, au ondoa /etc/geolocation ukiwa msimamizi.</value>
    <comment>Error state on linux: URnetwork wrote the system location file and can no longer remove it, so the machine may still be reporting a provider's location. Gives the user the recovery steps.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_coverage_gaps" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Haifuniki kila kitu. Chrome na KDE Plasma hazimwulizi GeoClue kamwe, na programu yoyote inayobaini mahali ulipo yenyewe kutokana na anwani yako ya IP haiathiriki. Firefox hurudi kwenye utafutaji wake wenyewe ikiwa mfumo haujibu haraka.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide and info popup on linux: the honest limits of the device location override. Paired with location_override_coverage_geoclue.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_coverage_geoclue" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Programu zinazoomba mahali ulipo kutoka kwa mfumo kupitia GeoClue — ikiwa ni pamoja na GNOME Settings and Maps, Firefox, na programu za Flatpak na Snap zinazoendeshwa kwenye sandbox — huripoti mahali pa mtoa huduma badala ya pako.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide and info popup on linux: what the device location override actually covers. Shown alongside location_override_coverage_gaps, which states the limits.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_ready" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Tayari. Washa kitufe ili kuripoti mahali pa mtoa huduma aliyeunganishwa kama mahali pa mashine hii.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide state on linux: every prerequisite for the device location override is met.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_step_geoclue" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sakinisha GeoClue 2.7 au toleo jipya zaidi. Haipatikani kwenye kila mfumo, na Ubuntu 22.04 na Debian 12 huja na toleo la zamani lisiloweza kufanya hivi.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide step on linux: the GeoClue version requirement for the device location override.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_step_service" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sakinisha huduma ya mfumo ya URnetwork. Faili ya mahali ya mfumo iko chini ya /etc, hivyo msaidizi mwenye ruhusa za juu ndiye anayepaswa kuiandika — URnetwork haikuombi kamwe uendeshe programu yenyewe ukiwa msimamizi.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide step on linux: the privileged helper needed to write the system location file. Reassures the user that the app itself never needs root.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="location_override_step_static_source" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Acha chanzo cha mahali kisichobadilika cha GeoClue kikiwa kimewashwa. Huwa kimewashwa kwa chaguomsingi; angalia /etc/geoclue/geoclue.conf ikiwa umekibadilisha.</value>
    <comment>Setup guide step on linux: keep GeoClue's static location source enabled so the override is read.</comment>
  </data>
