    <comment>Earnings card: how providers are paid on the UR subnet (WHITEPAPER §5.2, §8.3). Earnings settle per epoch and are paid in SN25α as stake to the provider's Bittensor coldkey once the provider claims them; nothing is paid automatically. Followed by sn_payout_schedule_times when the epoch schedule is known.</comment>
