    <comment>Earnings card, after sn_payout_schedule: when the current epoch ends, when its share can be claimed and when an unclaimed share expires. The three values are local date-times the app fills from the chain's epoch schedule (the coordinator's policy: the claim-open offset and the claim TTL), never fixed durations.</comment>
